			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce38e932-ef73-474c-a3dc-9859e416a25e")
	)
	(text "U900: TI TPS2553DBVR-1, active-high EN, latch-off.\nR900 115k: conditional 202.81–266.30mA screen.\nNominal model tests do NOT bound initial short surge\nor prove essential rail / healthy CAN survival."
		(at 25.4 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "99155ef4-45ca-40e8-bba7-de089d5b5da4")
	)
	(text "MCU: PD3 open drain, release enables; LOW disables.\nDisable UCPD dead-battery behavior before using PD0/PD3.\n2s LOW = discharge / latch-clear ATTEMPT, not guaranteed reset.\nReset releases default-on; qualify supply and fresh telemetry.\nNo autonomous repeated retries without qualified policy."
		(at 25.4 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8ec0e1c4-b937-4195-b0b6-707ab1f5ab49")
	)
	(text "C901–C908: 8 × 10uF, 10%, 50V, X7R, 1206.\nC910–C912 / C915: same individual capacitor.\nC909 / C913: 15nF, 10%, 50V, X7R, 0603.\nC900 / C914 / C916: 100nF, 10%, 100V, X7R, 0603.\nEffective capacitance, ESR, aging and layout remain gates."
		(at 116.84 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d292c8a-e676-4350-853e-8c7ba523651a")
	)
	(text "R900, R902–R911: TNPW0603, 0.1%, 25ppm/K,\n0.110W general P70. R901: CRCW1206 HP,\n1ohm, 1%, 100ppm/K, 0.75W P70.\nStored MPN/ratings queried; field display API limited.\n#FLG0900 models actual driven post-R901 passive filter."
		(at 116.84 201.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0bc79e5e-481b-427f-ac49-1a3971a3c313")
	)
	(text "U901: TI UCC33020RAQR, SEL→VCC = nominal 5V.\n15nF HF bypasses; reservoirs conditional, not guaranteed PVT.\nU902: ADI LT3014IS5#TRPBF, TSOT-23-5, 20mA device.\n16.9k / 10k sets screened 3.16376–3.40078V range.\nOutput static 9.300mA; intermediate allocation ≥14.109mA."
		(at 245.11 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "860ad54c-a6e9-4cfb-b9f3-d94a67501376")
	)
	(text "OPEN: coupled startup/prebias/repeated faults; all-path off feeds;\nweak source/UVLO; essential OV barrier; hot/pulse/SOA; EMC;\ncalibration/physical fit. No full gauging or flight acceptance.\nR910/R909/R911 aid discharge; unknown feeds prevent a\nfull-power-cycle guarantee. No PCB release from this drawing."
		(at 245.11 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "67b078a5-89a6-48c2-bb2e-2fd19f3e1fea")
	)
	(text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED\nConstruction authorized: TPS2553DBVR-1"
		(at 25.4 39.37 0)
		(effects
